(7544404, 1207979, 182284, '<td valign="top">This photo fits the challenge well but the objects at the base of the mountains are a bit distracting. I still gave an 8 because the composition and the colors really stand out.</td>', 'This photo fits the challenge well but the objects at the base of the mountains are a bit distracting. I still gave an 8 because the composition and the colors really stand out.', '2017-11-14 00:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544405, 1207927, 182284, '<td valign="top">I love waterfalls but I think this photo itself would have looked better in color. I like to see a little definition in waterfalls and this one has little to no definition thus making the photo appear flat. When the water is too silky it takes away from the motion of the falls.</td>', 'I love waterfalls but I think this photo itself would have looked better in color. I like to see a little definition in waterfalls and this one has little to no definition thus making the photo appear flat. When the water is too silky it takes away from the motion of the falls.', '2017-11-14 01:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
