(7545302, 1207922, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...congratulations on Red!  (As far as being tilted, on a shot like this, where there''s no horizon visible, I usually use the LR or PS rule on the edge of a building, assuming they are "usually" built straight up even if on a hill!)</td>', 'Beautiful shot...congratulations on Red!  (As far as being tilted, on a shot like this, where there''s no horizon visible, I usually use the LR or PS rule on the edge of a building, assuming they are "usually" built straight up even if on a hill!)', '2017-11-18 01:10:26.000000', NULL, 0),
